# ── calibrEAT license API — environment ─────────────────────────────
# Non-secret tuning lives in wrangler.toml [vars] (defaults shown there).
# SECRETS go in `wrangler secret put <NAME>` — never in wrangler.toml or git.

# Resend API key — verification-code emails. Free tier: 100 emails/day,
# 3,000/month (requires a verified sending domain).
# Leave unset to log codes to the console (dev only).
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Sender shown on verification emails (must be a domain verified in Resend).
EMAIL_FROM=calibrEAT <no-reply@calibreat.co.uk>

# Required on POST /v1/webhook/mor (header `x-webhook-secret` or
# `Authorization: Bearer`). Unset → every MoR webhook returns 503 (fail-closed).
MOR_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Dodo Payments webhook signing secret (whsec_…) — required for
# POST /v1/webhook/dodo. Shown once when you create the endpoint in
# Developer → Webhooks (test mode and live mode have different secrets).
DODO_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Dodo REST API key — GET /customers/{id} so license_key.created (which
# only includes customer_id, not email) can bind the buyer. Live keys
# need DODO_API_BASE=https://live.dodopayments.com (see wrangler.toml).
DODO_API_KEY=

# Required for POST /v1/admin/licenses (register codes manually / for testing).
ADMIN_TOKEN=

# Resend webhook signing secret (whsec_…) — required for POST /v1/webhook/inbound
# (support mail received at support@calibreat.co.uk via Resend Inbound). Shown once
# when you create the webhook in the Resend dashboard.
RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Support auto-ack sender, e.g. calibrEAT <no-reply@calibreat.co.uk>.
# Leave empty to disable auto-acknowledgement of support emails.
SUPPORT_FROM=